C_TEST
========

1.Introduction 
============
	The c_test is test automation frame work designed
to test the designerware IPs like MSHC, CGMAC, I3C etc.
The c_test includes basic drivers for these IPs, ctest core
frame work, which can run on os based (like linux) 
or non_os based (like arc platform).

platform used: PC, ARC board.

